---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, PRODUCT } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="Terms of Service" description="The terms for using Japan Import Hub and buying the Import Toolkit.">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="article-header">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="date">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>
    </header>
    <article class="prose">
      <p>By using {SITE.name}, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>

      <h2>The content on this site</h2>
      <p>
        Our guides are written to be accurate and genuinely helpful, but importing rules, shop
        policies, and shipping costs change over time and vary by country. Nothing on this site is
        legal, customs, or financial advice — always confirm specifics (like duty rates) with your
        own country's customs authority before making a purchase decision based on our estimates.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        We link to third-party retailers (Play-Asia, CDJapan) and earn a commission on qualifying
        purchases at no extra cost to you — see our <a href="/disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>.
        We are not the seller of record for anything purchased through these links; your purchase,
        shipping, and any returns are between you and that retailer, governed by their own terms.
      </p>

      <h2>The {PRODUCT.name} (digital product)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>This is a digital download ({PRODUCT.displayPrice}, one-time payment) — no physical item ships.</li>
        <li>Payment is processed securely by Stripe; we never see your card details.</li>
        <li>
          Because it's an instantly-delivered digital file, sales are generally final once
          downloaded. If something's genuinely wrong with your order (failed payment, corrupted
          file, wrong item), contact us with your receipt and we'll make it right.
        </li>
        <li>"Free lifetime updates" means access to future revisions of the same toolkit at no
          extra charge — it does not extend to unrelated future products.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The Landed Cost Calculator</h2>
      <p>
        Our <a href="/calculator">calculator</a> gives an estimate only, using exchange rates from a
        third-party rates API and duty percentages you enter yourself. We cannot guarantee it
        matches what customs actually charges on your specific shipment — always verify against
        your own country's rules for anything expensive.
      </p>

      <h2>Accounts</h2>
      <p>
        If you create an account to use the wishlist feature, you're responsible for keeping access
        to the email you signed up with. Don't use the account or wishlist features for anything
        illegal or abusive — we may suspend accounts that do.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} is provided "as is." To the extent permitted by law, we aren't liable for
        losses arising from customs charges, shipping issues, or purchases made through affiliate
        links to third-party stores — those transactions are between you and the retailer.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms as the site evolves; the date above reflects the latest revision.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach us via the contact details on our <a href="/about">About page</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
